  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i> </p><p>Frequently sold as a personal protection device, the Contact Stunner is a small, inconspicuous weapon, the forward end of which is covered with over a dozen contact disks, enabling it to deliver a concentrated and, therefore, effective discharge when it contacts a target. However, the Weapon's lack of mass makes it less useful for anything other than rendering a target unconscious. </p><p>Because of its slender and compact design, a Contact Stunner grants a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> checks made to conceal the weapon. A Contact Stunner requires an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a> to operate. </p>",
